                <pb facs="0631" n="543" sameAs="frus:frus1933v05/pg543"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">837.00/4533: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Cuba</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Matthews</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-12-18T09:00:00-05:00">December 18, 1933—9
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 10 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>524. Dr. Grau expressed a desire to meet me yesterday and I accordingly called at
                    the Palace last night.</p>
                <p>The press having learned of the visit I stated that I had merely told Dr. Grau
                    that Mr. Caffery would arrive this morning.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Matthews</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
